rule UnitsAndCurrency
	statement: Properties ending Inr are rupees. Properties ending Paise are exact integer paise (100 paise = 1 rupee) and are for reconciliation only. 'Crore' means 10,000,000 rupees. Properties ending Pct are percentages (8.5 = 8.5%). Product rupee parameters such as AnnualFeeInr are whole rupees.
	lineageTag: 00656018-8c12-5186-b0bf-1acd6897c8ea

	ruleReferencedEntity Account
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty PostedBalanceInr

	ruleReferencedEntity Product
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty InterestRatePct

		ruleReferencedProperty AnnualFeeInr

	ruleReferencedEntity Loan
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty AnnualRatePct
